AI capabilities and limitations based on project specifications
A good but imperfect rule of thumb:
  Anything you can do with 1 second of thought we can probably now of soon automate. 
    Ex. Transcribing text from audio to text
        Inspecting a phone to find defect
        Positioning of other cars relative to your car
As of now, AI cannot accurately predict the stock market
  Cannot predict the future price of a stock based on historical data
    A person cannot do this one or more seconds. It takes time and methodical study

What makes a project a good candiae for ML or AI
  1. Learning a "simple" concept
  2. Lots of data available
